            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "По акции второй кофе — бесплатно. Po áktsii vtoróy kófe — besplátno. On special offer, the second coffee is free."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. По акции — on special offer. Also a share on the stock market, or a protest."
